{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "libwebp",
  "version": "1.6.0",
  "group": "web",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/downloads.webmproject.org/releases/webp/libwebp-1.6.0.tar.gz",
    "archive": "libwebp-1.6.0.tar.gz",
    "source_dir": "libwebp-1.6.0",
    "sha256": "e4ab7009bf0629fd11982d4c2aa83964cf244cffba7347ecd39019a9e38c4564"
  },
  "dependencies": [
    "make"
  ],
  "build": {
    "system": "configure",
    "configure_args": [
      "--enable-libwebpdemux",
      "--enable-libwebpmux",
      "--enable-libwebpdecoder",
      "--disable-gl",
      "--disable-sdl",
      "--disable-png",
      "--disable-jpeg",
      "--disable-tiff",
      "--disable-gif",
      "--disable-wic"
    ],
    "env": {
      "CFLAGS": "-O2"
    },
    "make_args": [],
    "target_overrides": {
      "windows": {
        "configure_args": [
          "--build=@CRT_MINGW_TRIPLE@"
        ],
        "env": {
          "CFLAGS": "-U_WIN32 -U_WIN32_WCE -U__WIN32__ -UWIN32 -U__NT__ -U_MSC_VER",
          "lt_cv_deplibs_check_method": "pass_all"
        },
        "force_include": [
          "porting/shims/win32/libtool_wrapper_compat.h"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "roundtrip-static",
      "type": "compile-run",
      "source": "porting/tests/libwebp_roundtrip.c",
      "cflags": [
        "-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include"
      ],
      "link_args": [
        "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebpdemux.a",
        "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebp.a",
        "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libsharpyuv.a"
      ],
      "expect_stdout": "libwebp_roundtrip_test: ok",
      "target_overrides": {
        "windows": {
          "cflags": [
            "-U_WIN32",
            "-U_WIN32_WCE",
            "-U__WIN32__",
            "-UWIN32",
            "-U__NT__",
            "-U_MSC_VER"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "roundtrip-shared",
      "type": "compile-run",
      "source": "porting/tests/libwebp_roundtrip.c",
      "cflags": [
        "-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include"
      ],
      "link_args": [],
      "expect_stdout": "libwebp_roundtrip_test: ok",
      "target_overrides": {
        "linux": {
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebpdemux.so",
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebp.so"
          ]
        },
        "macos": {
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebpdemux.dylib",
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebp.dylib"
          ],
          "env": {
            "CRT_CXX_RUNTIME_LINKAGE": "shared"
          }
        },
        "windows": {
          "cflags": [
            "-U_WIN32",
            "-U_WIN32_WCE",
            "-U__WIN32__",
            "-UWIN32",
            "-U__NT__",
            "-U_MSC_VER"
          ],
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebpdemux.dll.a",
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libwebp.dll.a"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "status": {
    "linux": "shared-pass",
    "macos": "shared-pass",
    "windows": "shared-pass"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Added 2026-10-10 for Web Tranche 3B milestone B2: WebKit's FindWebP requires libwebp with the demux component (WebCore's WebP image decoder uses WebPDemux).",
    "Image-format tools (cwebp, dwebp, ...) and the GL/SDL/PNG/JPEG/TIFF/GIF front ends are off: only the libraries are needed. Native macOS and Windows/x64 replays are now recorded below.",
    "macOS shared tests run with CRT_CXX_RUNTIME_LINKAGE=shared (test-level env): the executable links libc.dylib, the libc every dylib of the port loads, instead of a second static libc.a (Mach-O two-level namespace: two malloc/pthread registries in one process).",
    "Windows/x64 2026-10-19: fresh SDK-mode configure/make -j4/install and roundtrip-static/roundtrip-shared pass with CRT mksh/make after the PAL fork HANDLE/RNG/DIR/live-stack corrections. The immutable 05-ui input remains unchanged; full isolated 06-web acceptance is separate (docs/bringup/windows_mksh_tranche10_crash.md). Windows/arm64 native port replay is not claimed."
  ]
}
